Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FallingObjectScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1, :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :barrel1 ;
    :hasEvidence :indicator1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Worker standing next to vehicle" .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Van parked on the side of the road" .

:barrel1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Falling barrel moving into vehicle path" .

:indicator1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Bright daylight, clear sky" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Imminent collision with falling object in roadway" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Imminent collision with a falling barrel that is obstructing the vehicle's path.
Severity Score: 0.92